# listfly.uis -- a list without a selection (-1) that gets the keyboard focus in the first frame
# of a new flyout (test hook 9061: a flyout at the pointer, popup_open + ui.focus on its list,
# like JFNetworker's port choice).  The focus alone selects nothing: the list keeps -1 and the
# layout settles; Down selects the first row.  With arg 1 the app takes no row and puts -1 back
# (no port fits): when focusing still selected row 0, that repeated in every pass and the layout
# did not settle within 4 passes (UIWARN).
move 300,300
cmd 9061
expect text:"Liste im Flyout" exists
expect #7910 focused
expect #7910 value -1
expect_nowarn
key down
expect #7911 selected
expect #7910 value 0
key esc
expect text:"Liste im Flyout" missing
# no row can be chosen
cmd 9061 1
expect text:"Liste im Flyout" exists
expect #7910 focused
expect #7910 value -1
expect_nowarn
key down
expect #7910 value -1
expect_nowarn
key esc
expect text:"Liste im Flyout" missing
